Date: Thu, 21 May 2026 18:36:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fsl-imx-demo: Improve IMXChreDemo functionality

This fixes a null object reference that causes the app to crash
if a user clicks the UNLOAD NANOAPP, QUERY NANOAPP, or SEND MESSAGE
buttons first.

The original design required a strict sequence of button clicks:
1. CONTEXT HUB INFO
2. QUERY NANOAPP
Otherwise, the app would crash, for example, when clicking the SEND MESSAGE
button first.

Move this functionality to onCreate():

Extract the ContextHubClient creation code from the button handler
and wrap it in the registerContextHubClient() function to call it
in onCreate().

Extract the code for getting the nanoappStateList from the button handler
and wrap it in the updateNanoAppState() function to call it in onCreate()
and whenever the nanoapp list is updated.

Important note: This IMXChreDemo UI demo is a proof of concept and
requires further development.

Signed-off-by: Natalia Kovalenko <natasha.k@variscite.com>
